WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:08.190
"Typhoon Information:
High Wind / Violent Storm"

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:07.650
As the typhoon approaches, the wind and
rain are becoming... quite... strong, and--

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.820
Ah! Are you okay?!

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.320
--Please avoid going out today
unless it's absolutely necessary.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.910
--This means... we just have to play inside.
--Please avoid going out today
unless it's absolutely necessary.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.120
--This means... we just have to play inside.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.910
Y-Yeah... Wait, that's your concern?

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:22.660
"Ice"
"Entrance"

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:25.380
To and Hotaru said they'd 
come over later, but...

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:29.420
"Shikada Dagashi"

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.390
I wonder if they'll be okay...

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:05.430
"Entrance"

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.770
Hey, Coconuts...

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:05.430
What's this?

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:08.940
"Baseball Board Game Gum"

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.940
I've been wondering ever since I got here.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:14.230
Oh, that? That's Baseball Board Game Gum.
We decided to start carrying it again.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:14.940
Gum?

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:19.200
It's not a toy? It looks like
it's got a switch or something.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.450
"Baseball Board Game Gum"

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:21.280
Then try pressing it.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:22.450
This?

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:29.370
The gum goes through that baseball
board game like thing and pops out.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.670
I see...

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:32.500
You press a button, and something happens...

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:37.010
Something as simple as that
is enough to entertain kids.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.340
"Baseball Board Game Gum"

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:42.970
In addition, depending on the color of the gum
you get, you can get a voucher for the shop,

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:39.430
"100-yen snack voucher"

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.090
"100-yen snack voucher"
"50-yen snack voucher"

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:40.840
"100-yen snack voucher"
"50-yen snack voucher"
"30-yen snack voucher"

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:42.010
"100-yen snack voucher"
"50-yen snack voucher"
"30-yen snack voucher" "Sorry, no voucher"

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:46.520
so kids tend to just keep
pressing it without thinking!

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.510
"You pressed five times,
so that'll be 50 yen."

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:46.520
"You pressed five times,
so that'll be 50 yen."
"What?! You're such a schemer, Coconuts!"

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:51.480
At that point, they're not even
doing it because they want gum!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.190
That's kinda sneaky.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.770
Hm? Is it sneaky?

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:58.440
They seem all excited and
don't complain about paying,

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:00.700
so I thought it was a good way to make money.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.450
Ah, well, if that's the case,
I guess it's not a problem.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:09.290
B-Besides, even a kid wouldn't just
keep pressing it over and over--

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.840
What're you doing, Hotaru?

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.760
What was I just doing?!

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.640
Ah... Not a single winner...

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.600
That's your issue?!
Actually, when'd you get here?!

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.100
Baseball Board Game Gum...

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:34.020
It really has the magical power to make
you want to press it without thinking.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:35.650
"Not a single winner"

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:38.690
Well... you're pretty much the only person
who'd press it that many times.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:36.520
"Not a single winner"
"Not a single winner"

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.520
Oh? You really think so?

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.030
Hey, that wasn't a compliment!

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:47.530
Anyway, you're soaking wet. Are you okay?

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.380
I-I'll go get a towel.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.880
At any rate, you really came in this storm?

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:03.930
Of course! Don't typhoons make you so
excited that you want to go outside?!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.890
What are you, a little kid?

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.220
Anyway, I wonder what I should do...

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:09.890
About what?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:14.850
I thought it'd be tough 
to go home in this rain.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.770
Were you planning on going home?

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:17.400
What?

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.150
Why don't you stay overnight?
It's dangerous out.

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.240
Oh, you don't mind?

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.650
S-Stay overnight?

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:27.410
Yeah, it's crazy outside.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:32.000
B-But... This is so sudden...
We shouldn't rush things.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.500
We should take things slow.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:34.420
He's right.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:38.420
It's dangerous outside.
You guys all stay overnight here.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.090
Oh, hi, Yo.

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.800
Well, you're on summer break.
Once in a while is probably okay.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:46.260
Since... the typhoon...

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:52.140
...makes me so excited that I wanna
go outside, I'll go check the rice paddies!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.270
What?!

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:56.770
"Shikada Dagashi"
"Kids at home, do not try this, okay?"

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.690
Dad...

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:01.770
And so, and so...

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.700
"Shikada Dagashi"

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:06.700
The rain and wind are both
getting stronger and stronger

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.060
To said that he'd come,
but I wonder if he'll be okay...

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.120
Oh? When did you--

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.520
I went ahead and took a bath.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.920
You're drinking milk and relaxing?!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.960
Wait, why did you already take a bath?!

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.220
You want to know why I took a bath?

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:31.140
Maybe it was because I was
chilled down to my very bones

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.220
after trudging through 
all that rain and wind!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.730
Hm? Why are you upset?

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.980
Seriously, I can't believe 
you came in this storm.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:43.320
Of course I did! It'd be terribly
lonely staying at home by myself!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:46.200
That's not something you say
while trying to act cool!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.570
Well, hear me out.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:48.990
Wh-What?

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.990
We're gonna spend the 
night here today, right?

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.910
Say, you wanna get cozy with Coconuts, right?

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.000
Huh?! It's not like that.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.250
Kokonotsu.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.580
About tonight's dinner... Oh, hi, Endo.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:03.000
Hi! I took a bath first.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.920
You came in this typhoon?
That must've been tough.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:10.430
Of course I did. Typhoons make
me want to go outside!

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.180
I know exactly what you mean.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.340
Well then, it's our turn now, Master Saya!

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:16.930
What?

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.290
Bath time! Let's take a bath together!

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:35.370
Now, Master Saya, let's play!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.410
What? Play?

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.870
Yes indeedy!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:42.880
"Indeedy"? Okay, but what do you wanna do?

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.380
I'm glad you asked.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.630
No! You mustn't, To!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.130
Don't stop me, Coconuts.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:54.140
I have to go... at all costs!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.600
Don't! If you peep, you'll become a criminal!

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.320
Shut up!

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:01.650
They're taking a bath!
What other choice do we have?!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.610
What kind of logic is that?

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:07.650
Are you saying we should just loaf
around at a critical time like this?!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:08.490
That's right!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.140
Don't you... wanna see...

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:14.530
Hotaru's boo--

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.660
I do!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:24.840
That's exactly why I wanna wait until the
time is right, when I can gaze at them

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.420
freely without the fear 
of becoming a criminal!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.340
Coconuts...

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.340
I see...

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:36.350
So you get it, To?

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.310
Let's put that aside for now
and get on with the peeping!

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.650
You're so shallow!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:46.190
Hey...

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:48.390
Mind telling me what you're doing?

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.780
Ah... well... you know...

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.740
...we were just out catching
some bugs and stuff.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:08:00.200
Don't go screwing around during
a typhoon, you jerkwad!

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.120
Seriously...

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.540
What was that?

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.130
Just some bugs.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.130
Bugs?

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:08.640
Don't worry about it.
So what do you mean by "play"?

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:13.720
When it comes to playing in
the bathtub, it's gotta be this!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:14.730
This!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.390
A boat?

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.180
Yeah. A pop pop boat.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.230
"Pop pop"... That's cute!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.590
It's a boat, but it's not
just your typical boat.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.940
You don't just put it on the water.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.020
The pop pop boat is a steamboat.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.090
First, you put some water 
in it using a straw.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.700
Next, you light the candle...

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:43.420
...and carefully set it inside the boat.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:47.460
Then, the water inside gets boiled, and...

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.340
...the boat starts moving.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:52.840
Whoa!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:58.100
The name "pop pop boat" comes from
this "pop pop" boiling sound...

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:02.430
What? "Pop pop"? It sounds 
like "swish swish."

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:04.520
Or maybe it comes from something else.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:05.600
Now you're not sure?!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:08.440
Ah, but, you know, Master Saya...

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.610
The pop pop boat is said to
be the first powered toy

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:15.030
and kids loved using it to learn science...

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:19.960
Hotaru... Her unique way of interacting
with people is mysterious...

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.870
...though I don't dislike it.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.370
Hey, Kokonotsu!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:26.920
Sorry, but--

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.750
Dad? Where are you right now?

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.000
Let's see, this is--

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.590
Ah! Hotaru! Why're you
walking around like that?!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.130
Um...

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:37.470
Hm? No, Saya. The futon is over there!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:37.970
Well...?

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:41.470
Ah! To! Don't open that door!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.890
Sorry, Dad. We're okay here.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:49.900
"Akonomiyaki"

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.810
Tamai!

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:52.270
Shut up! Don't come here!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:58.500
It kinda feels weird that everyone's here.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:05.210
Pop pop boat, huh? Dad and I often
used to play with these together.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:26.680
Kokonotsu...

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:27.520
Whoa!

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.900
You can play with it if you like.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:35.870
H-Hotaru! Please don't peep!

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:37.990
"Baseball Board Game Gum, 
Pop Pop Boat, and..."

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:16.510
"Next time: Beigoma, Reminiscence, and..."

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.320
Next time: "Beigoma, Reminiscence, and..."

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.790
I can't lose in this game!
